      <h1>Remove Photo Metadata on Android</h1>
      <p class="lead">
        Strip GPS geotags, Samsung/Pixel device signatures, capture dates, and EXIF tags from your Android photos before posting online.
      </p>
    </header>

    <div class="tool-wrapper">
      <ToolDrop
        id="android-cleaner"
